This is a placeholder for background.png. Please replace this file with your actual background image.
Make sure the image is named background.png and placed in the /public directory.
For example, if your project is in 'my-app', the path would be 'my-app/public/background.png'.
The application will then use this image as the background for all pages except the main page.
The image provided by the user was a light, creamy, abstract pattern.
